<td style="background: #6D6E71; color:#ffffff; font-size: 110%;" align="center" colspan="2"><b>Convention</b>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" align="center" style="background:#FFD100"><b>Freedom Calls</b>
</td></tr>
<tr style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; font-size:95%;">
<td style="width:30%; font-weight:bold;">Dates:
</td>
<td style="width:70%;">May 22-25
</td></tr>
<tr style="text-align:left; vertical-align:top; font-size:95%;">
<td style="width:30%; font-weight:bold;">Location:
</td>
<td style="width:70%;">Grand Rapids, MI
