</td>
<td style="width:70%;">The Amway Grand Plaza Hotel
</td></tr>















<tr>
<td style="border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius-bottomleft: 10px; -webkit-border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; -khtml-border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; -icab-border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; -o-border-bottom-left-radius: 10px; border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius-bottomright: 10px; -webkit-border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; -khtml-border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; -icab-border-bottom-right-radius: 10px; -o-border-bottom-right-radius: 10px;; background: #56565a; color:#ffffff; font-size: 110%;" align="center" colspan="2">
<table style="color:#ffffff; width:100%">

<tbody><tr>
<td align="left"><a href="/wiki/National_Convention_2024" title="National Convention 2024"><span style="color:white;">&#8592; 2024</span></a>
</td>
<td align="right"><a href="/wiki/National_Convention_2028" title="National Convention 2028"><span style="color:white;">2028 &#8594;</span></a>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>The <b>2026 Libertarian National Convention,</b> the biannual <a href="/wiki/Libertarian_Party#National_Conventions" title="Libertarian Party">Libertarian Party</a> National Convention, was <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://www.lnc2026.com/">held in Grand Rapids, Michigan</a>.  On May 1, 2025, it was announced that the convention theme would be "Freedom Calls." There was a <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://lp.org/2026-national-convention-theme-submissions/">Theme Contest</a>.
</p>
