<p><i>Moellman and O'Brien selected the five remaining members of the Judicial Committee via a joint statement on May 31, <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer noopener" class="external text" href="https://www.facebook.com/ken.moellman/posts/pfbid02DGQXu1NeuALMJU3g5qJmTjKzjBzMwMq9U7S8yKKSXmJubcpCJCvL17bdY6vxMM1Hl">2026</a>. Those appointed members were Pat Dixon, Mary Gingell, Sam Goldstein, Dr. Chuck Moulton, and Geoffrey Neale.</i>
</p>
